# Arcade stations are iGPU-only

Prod and friend stations are refurb 8th-gen Intel i5 mini PCs (UHD 630 class) driving 1080p. **No discrete GPU.** Do not add titles that need a real graphics card.

## Allowed

- RetroArch: SNES, GBA, Genesis, DOS, N64 at modest internal res
- 2D natives: Mindustry, OpenTTD, shapez (FOSS), Endless Sky, Super Solvers via DOSBox
- SuperTuxKart only at low/medium 1080p if we add it

## Tune or skip

- Luanti/Minetest: short view distance, no fancy shaders. Playable, not pretty.
- Skip Veloren, Space Station 14, 0 A.D. at default, anything Unreal/Unity "recommended GPU"

## Also

- Free-to-play-and-host only (no Factorio-style per-seat paid clients)
- Do not put ROMs/zips/cores in git
